m/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117831","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117831","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117831.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117831.patch","merged_at":"2026-03-31T15:53:17Z"},"body":"I ran into this seemingly low-hanging fruit while doing some profiling.\r\n\r\nThese are the results we're seeing in `GDScriptFunction::call`, in a real-world project using a fork of 4.6.1-stable, when running the exact same replay of the game both times, on an AMD 9950X3D running Fedora 43.\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"789\" height=\"278\" alt=\"Before\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7970ff88-9961-4f2f-9ac0-942f0357ebd7\" />\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"792\" height=\"283\" alt=\"After\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1b997710-f9e4-4cd6-a630-f8d4339f0010\" />\r\n\r\nThe leftmost number in the gutter is probably the more interesting one in this case, as it represents how many of the `GDScriptFunction:call` samples it made up.\r\n\r\n~~This `temporary_slots` doesn't really need to be a map at all, since there's no actual lookup happening, and could just as well be a `LocalVector<Pair<int, Variant::Type>>` instead, but the performance gains were identical, so I opted for this smaller change. I'm fine with either one though.~~\r\n\r\n(I tried also ditching `type_init_function_table` in favor of an explicit `switch`, but saw surprisingly little gains.)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/